sail-aarch64-oracle — licensing
================================

This project's OWN source code — everything authored in this repository:
`src/`, `csrc/`, `sail/`, `build.rs`, `scripts/`, the test suite, and the
documentation — is licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License (below).

It also BUNDLES and (by default) statically links several third-party
components under their own licenses; see "Third-party components" at the end.
Most notably, the bundled GMP arithmetic (mini-gmp) is LGPL/GPL, so a
DISTRIBUTED BINARY of this crate is a combined work subject to those terms
as well. The accurate combined SPDX expression is:

    BSD-3-Clause AND BSD-3-Clause-Clear AND BSD-2-Clause AND MIT
      AND (LGPL-3.0-or-later OR GPL-2.0-or-later)

