===============================================================================
Third-party components (in vendor/; see vendor/README.md for provenance)
===============================================================================

* vendor/model.cpp.gz, vendor/model.h, vendor/model_missing.cpp
    Generated from rems-project/sail-arm arm-v9.4-a, a translation of Arm's
    ASL specification.
    License: BSD-3-Clause-Clear.
    Copyright (c) 2023 Arm Limited (or its affiliates), Thomas Bauereiss,
    Brian Campbell, Alasdair Armstrong, Alastair Reid, Peter Sewell.

* vendor/sail-runtime/{sail,rts,sail_failure,sail_config}.{c,h} (patched)
    The Sail C runtime, from the `sail` package.
    License: BSD-2-Clause. Copyright (c) the Sail authors / contributors
    (University of Cambridge et al.).

* vendor/sail-runtime/cJSON.{c,h}
    License: MIT. Copyright (c) 2009-2017 Dave Gamble and cJSON contributors.

* vendor/sail-runtime/mini-gmp.{c,h}, mini-mpq.{c,h}
    From GMP 6.3.0. License: dual LGPL-3.0-or-later OR GPL-2.0-or-later.
    Copyright (c) the Free Software Foundation, Inc.
    >> This is the only copyleft component. It is bundled and statically
    >> linked by default, so redistributing a built binary triggers the
    >> LGPL's obligations (provide the GMP source — included here — and allow
    >> relinking). Building with SAIL_SYSTEM_GMP links the system libgmp
    >> instead, which is LGPL all the same. Full GMP license texts:
    >> https://www.gnu.org/licenses/lgpl-3.0.html and
    >> https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.html
